      "cooked": "<p>I don't know what the full game costs, all in ($30?). &nbsp;But I'd love if I could pay some crazy amount of money, say, $150 or something, and then have an account that would let my friends play the full game, all characters, etc, when they are in the game with me.</p><p>I've convinved some of my friends to buy the game when it was on sale, but they only have the base game, and while it's great, it's kinda stale. &nbsp;It's been hard to convince them they should buy the expansions, since they aren't as into as I am.</p>",
